WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:07.456
At Ray's house Ally and Mateo were trying to bring Alpha back to life.

2
00:00:07.457 --> 00:00:11.708
Ally was worried. "The signal keeps getting fainter.

3
00:00:11.709 --> 00:00:15.674
I've already lost my pod. I can't lose Alpha too!

4
00:00:15.675 --> 00:00:19.375
How are we going to charge her back up?"

5
00:00:19.376 --> 00:00:22.187
Mateo tapped his chin, thinking.

6
00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:29.723
"There's an episode of Cosmic Quest where the crew recovers the motherboard from the crash site of their enemy's ship.

7
00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:34.140
They put the motherboard into a Cosmolink device to retrieve the data."

8
00:00:34.141 --> 00:00:38.788
"But I don't have a Cosmolink," Ally moaned.

9
00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:43.425
"I don't even have a computer or phone I can put Alpha into."

10
00:00:43.426 --> 00:00:53.014
Mateo grinned. Then he ran to his room and returned with a small, foldable device.

11
00:00:53.015 --> 00:01:04.111
"It's just a model from Cosmic Quest , but it's rechargeable. It's worth a try."

12
00:01:04.112 --> 00:01:08.611
"Please work," Ally whispered as she put Alpha inside the device.

13
00:01:08.612 --> 00:01:12.032
As soon as Ally closed the back, Alpha burst back to life.

14
00:01:12.033 --> 00:01:18.846
"I am A-A-Alpha CXB unit serial number 7638hbc81 a-a-at your service."

15
00:01:18.847 --> 00:01:24.710
"Alpha!" Ally cried. "You're back. I'm sorry I lost you."

16
00:01:24.711 --> 00:01:27.788
"Quick, to the ship!" Alpha said.

17
00:01:27.789 --> 00:01:29.966
"What?" Ally cried.

18
00:01:29.967 --> 00:01:37.952
"Roses are red, a-a-apples are green . . . 12,000 divided by 18 is equal to the trajectory of a robin in flight."

19
00:01:37.953 --> 00:01:41.841
"Are you trying to be funny?" Ally asked.

20
00:01:41.842 --> 00:01:44.775
"The sun is blue," Alpha replied.

21
00:01:44.776 --> 00:01:47.870
Ally and Mateo exchanged worried looks.

22
00:01:47.871 --> 00:01:50.932
"Let's let her charge overnight," Mateo said.

23
00:01:50.933 --> 00:02:03.519
"Hopefully she'll be back to herself after a full charge."

24
00:02:03.520 --> 00:02:11.696
*** The next morning Ally was awakened by her favorite dance track. "Turn it off, Mateo. It's too

25
00:02:11.697 --> 00:02:17.704
loud." But Mateo didn't reply through the door. Ally sat up and looked at the device charging

26
00:02:17.705 --> 00:02:21.283
nearby. Its lights were blinking, and the music was coming from its

27
00:02:21.284 --> 00:02:23.680
speaker. "Alpha! You're

28
00:02:23.681 --> 00:02:28.293
back!" "Affirmative," Alpha said. "Dance party

29
00:02:28.294 --> 00:02:31.106
time!" Ally leaped out of bed and danced

30
00:02:31.107 --> 00:02:43.903
around. Soon Mateo knocked on the door and joined in the

31
00:02:43.904 --> 00:02:53.648
fun. When the song ended, Alpha said, "Status report: the pod is completely

32
00:02:53.649 --> 00:03:00.496
destroyed." "It's all my fault, Alpha," Ally said. "I forgot to cloak the pod when I left the

33
00:03:00.497 --> 00:03:04.419
park. You warned me about that—I should have

34
00:03:04.420 --> 00:03:11.294
listened." "Affirmative," Alpha said. "But Alpha made a tactical error by sending out a distress

35
00:03:11.295 --> 00:03:16.191
signal. Instead of alerting Allyzooba, the signal attracted an intruder to the pod."

36
00:03:16.192 --> 00:03:22.454
"I promise, I will keep you with me every minute of the day from now on," Ally vowed.

37
00:03:22.455 --> 00:03:29.117
"And I promise to work on making the coils," Mateo said. "I think the pod is destroyed forever.

38
00:03:29.118 --> 00:03:34.757
But maybe we can figure out how to send a distress signal out to the galaxy to call for help."

39
00:03:34.758 --> 00:03:39.095
"Alpha approves of that plan," Alpha said.

40
00:03:39.096 --> 00:03:42.105
"I'd better get ready for work," Ally said.

41
00:03:42.106 --> 00:03:46.559
"I'm going to help Flo today with plans for the gala on Saturday."

42
00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:51.783
"Speaking of which . . ." Mateo slapped his forehead.

43
00:03:51.784 --> 00:03:56.466
"I forgot all about my one-month anniversary with Bethany on Saturday.

44
00:03:56.467 --> 00:03:59.988
I still haven't thought of a fun surprise for her."

45
00:03:59.989 --> 00:04:03.867
"Oh! I thought of a great idea," Ally said.

46
00:04:03.868 --> 00:04:07.934
"What if we plan a scavenger hunt for her?

47
00:04:07.935 --> 00:04:12.250
You can leave her clues and little presents all over town.

48
00:04:12.251 --> 00:04:21.374
My parents did that for my 85th birthday, it was so much fun!"

49
00:04:21.375 --> 00:04:26.428
Mateo blinked in surprise. "You're that old?"

50
00:04:26.429 --> 00:04:30.601
"I'm even older now, of course," Ally said, confused.

51
00:04:30.602 --> 00:04:35.245
"Why are you so surprised—do I look older than that?"

52
00:04:35.246 --> 00:04:39.719
"Never mind," Mateo said. "I love your idea.

53
00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:43.932
I'll come by the diner later, and we can plan it all out."

54
00:04:43.933 --> 00:04:49.272
He left for soccer camp.

55
00:04:49.273 --> 00:04:58.123
"If I can't get home to Astralia yet," Ally said to Alpha, "the next best thing is being a good Astralian and helping humans."

56
00:04:58.124 --> 00:05:04.667
"Affirmative," Alpha replied.

57
00:05:04.668 --> 00:05:07.727
*** Ally kept Alpha in her apron pocket all day at work.

58
00:05:07.728 --> 00:05:13.182
Luckily Barry wasn't working, so Ally didn't have to worry about him.

59
00:05:13.183 --> 00:05:17.788
After the breakfast rush, Ally sat down at the counter with Flo.

60
00:05:17.789 --> 00:05:23.786
She glanced at Ray, who was whistling as he left the kitchen and went into his office.

61
00:05:23.787 --> 00:05:29.210
"Ray's mood always improves when you work, Flo," Ally said.

62
00:05:29.211 --> 00:05:33.743
"I think he likes my silly jokes," Flo replied.

63
00:05:33.744 --> 00:05:38.867
"Yes, that must be it." Ally smiled.

64
00:05:38.868 --> 00:05:44.654
A few minutes later, Ray called Ally and Flo into the office.

65
00:05:44.655 --> 00:05:52.151
"I just got a call from the league," Ray said. "Now a rocket science VIP is coming to the gala."

66
00:05:52.152 --> 00:05:57.639
Ally gulped. "A VIP?" she thought.

67
00:05:57.640 --> 00:06:05.914
"I hope that doesn't stand for Valuable Intergalactic Predator, otherwise known as an alien hunter!"

